Open the sidemenu
Click the "E-Chart" link
Type "%" in @name=sstring
Click the "Search" button
Click the TEST-10050 link
@pause@driver.pause(5)
Click the "Medical Record" charttab
Click the Allergies/Medications link
Begin "Submit first observation to set baseline"
	Click the @height and weight obs span@xpath="//span[@title='Edit Height/Weight']"
	Type 154 in @name=height
	Type 163 in @name=weight
	Click the -1st Submit button
	@pause@driver.pause(5)
	Verify exists "163 lbs (73.94 kg)" text
	Verify exists "154 in (391.2 cm)" text
Begin "Submit second observation to verify change of data"
	Click the @height and weight obs span@xpath="//span[@title='Edit Height/Weight']"
	Type 150 in @name=height
	Type 180 in @name=weight
	Click the -1st Submit button
	@pause@driver.pause(5)
	Verify exists "180 lbs (81.65 kg)" text
	Verify exists "150 in (381.0 cm)" text